/-!
# A.3: Structure theory for strongly quasithin K-groups

The current proved interface provides the C-component definition, its elementary
restriction and existence theorems (A.3.1–A.3.4), the ordinary-component
comparison (A.3.3(5)–(7)), and the local family and inclusion theorem
(A.3.10–A.3.11). The embedding classification results of A.3.6–A.3.21 are
not yet established here.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, combined
1 March 2004 manuscript, §A.3, pp. 41–56. The proof of the final lemma A.3.21
continues on p. 56.
-/
